<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίπλοος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλόκ-πλους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sailing round</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγητὴρ
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.559
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>that may be sailed round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐστὶν ἡ γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.97
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολωνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἰσθμὸν περίπλουν
			ἐργαζόμενος</span> making it a <i>passage by water</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>VA</u>
				4.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>enfolding</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν λοβοῖς πολλάκις
				κοίλῃ περιπλόοις</span>
			<i>enfolding</i> the vena cava, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
